        "title": "What an honour!",
        "text": "One on the most holy of Hindu sites in Nepal! From across the banks of the river I had the honour of watching as the bodies of those recently passed were prepared for cremation, placed on the pyre and set ablaze. There are about 8-10 pyres you you can see various stages of the process. Once the body is completely reduced to ash it is placed in the river which flows into the most holy Ganges in India. This was an experience I won't soon forget.",
